{"id":"7745a6d434bbe885","group":"92","path":"92/92-thm-shepherdson-representation.md","title":"Shepherdson’s Representation Theorem S1","display":"thm-shepherdson-representation — Shepherdson’s Representation Theorem S1","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-thm-shepherdson-representation","aliases":["92-thm-shepherdson-representation"],"display":"thm-shepherdson-representation — Shepherdson’s Representation Theorem S1","source":"第 VII 章 pp. 86–89，Theorem S1（PDF 103–106）","source_status":"原书内容的显式重构","depends_on":["[[92-lem-shepherdson-representation]]","[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-ce-set]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-thm-shepherdson-representation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-thm-shepherdson-representation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shepherdson-representation — Shepherdson’s Representation Theorem S1"},{"key":"source","html":"第 VII 章 pp. 86–89，Theorem S1（PDF 103–106）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的显式重构"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8a3cbbd03d905ffa\" href=\"?note=8a3cbbd03d905ffa\" title=\"92-lem-shepherdson-representation\">92-lem-shepherdson-representation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8d06776406d2e58e\" href=\"?note=8d06776406d2e58e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system\">92-df-smullyan-rosser-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"69a2a133da01f9c9\" href=\"?note=69a2a133da01f9c9\" title=\"92-df-ce-set\">92-df-ce-set</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)\\)</span> 表示仅二元关系的 Rosser 性质，见<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8d06776406d2e58e\" href=\"?note=8d06776406d2e58e\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system\">92-df-smullyan-rosser-system</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE},\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^1\">\\(\\mathrm{CE},\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^1\\)</span> 为 c.e. 谓词与普通可表示性质。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^1(A)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^1(A)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A\\}\">\\(U=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V=\\{(x,y)\\mid\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}\">\\(V=\\{(x,y)\\mid\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}\\)</span>；二者均 c.e.，因为实例码函数可计算且可证码集 c.e.。二元 Rosser 性质提供分离 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\setminus V\">\\(U\\setminus V\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\setminus U\">\\(V\\setminus U\\)</span> 的公式。一致性把强分离转成弱分离；上游表示引理遂给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的普通表示公式。</p>\n<p>无需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> 一致性，也不要求非成员实例的否定可证。c.e. 非递归集合普通可表示，与<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f80a790e5ccd9d21\" href=\"?note=f80a790e5ccd9d21\" title=\"92-thm-ce-incompleteness\">92-thm-ce-incompleteness</a>排除旧强 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Rep_G\">\\(Rep_G\\)</span> 的结论完全相容。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 VII 章 pp. 86–89，Theorem S1（PDF 103–106）。页码同时给出印刷页与 PDF 页；所有公式均为本地重构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-lem-shepherdson-representation","status":"resolved","id":"8a3cbbd03d905ffa","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-shepherdson-representation]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system","status":"resolved","id":"8d06776406d2e58e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"69a2a133da01f9c9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-ce-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-rosser-system","status":"resolved","id":"8d06776406d2e58e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)$ 表示仅二元关系的 Rosser 性质，见[[92-df-smullyan-rosser-system]]。","embed":false},{"target":"92-thm-ce-incompleteness","status":"resolved","id":"f80a790e5ccd9d21","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"无需 $\\omega$ 一致性，也不要求非成员实例的否定可证。c.e. 非递归集合普通可表示，与[[92-thm-ce-incompleteness]]排除旧强 $Rep_G$ 的结论完全相容。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSys}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE},\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shepherdson\\text{-}representation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Con}(\\mathcal S)\\land\\mathrm{Axable}_G(\\mathcal S)\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserRel}_G^2(\\mathcal S)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{SRepSet}_{\\mathcal S}^1(A)).","display":true},{"tex":"U=\\{(x,y)\\mid x\\in A\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V=\\{(x,y)\\mid\\Pi_G(y,x,y)\\in P_{\\mathcal S}^{\\#}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"U\\setminus V","display":false},{"tex":"V\\setminus U","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"Rep_G","display":false}],"bytes":1877,"backlinks":[{"id":"baf256d78d60c2a6","anchor":"ref-77","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-local-binary-instance-code]] → [[92-df-weak-separation]] → [[92-lem-shepherdson-representation]] → [[92-thm-shepherdson-representation]]。"},{"id":"afb86879a743e8fe","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-304","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-thm-shepherdson-representation]]"}],"outgoing":["8a3cbbd03d905ffa","8d06776406d2e58e","c7befd96bd551ade","69a2a133da01f9c9","f80a790e5c